  "accepted_answers": [
    "John II Orsini",
    "John Komnenos Asen"
  ],
  "explanation": "The original sources directly state that Anna Palaiologina was married to John II Orsini and later to John Komnenos Asen. These claims are supported by D1S1 and D1S2, respectively. Other proposed candidates like Manuel II Palaiologos, Thomas Preljubović, John VIII Palaiologos, and Andronikos III Palaiologos either refer to different individuals or are not supported by direct evidence in the provided context."
}

